  "title": "Vanilla +",
  "description": "Vanilla + offers stunning shaders, enhanced world, extra mobs variants, diverse biomes, and revamped structures.",
  "body": "# Vanilla + Modpack Features\n\n## Enhanced Visuals\nExperience breathtaking shaders, from dynamic weather to immersive lighting, enriching every corner of your Minecraft world with unparalleled beauty and realism.\n\n## Dynamic World\nExplore diverse biomes and discover remastered structures in the End and Nether, offering breathtaking landscapes and thrilling challenges.\n\n## Varied Mobs\nEncounter a diverse array of creatures with unique behaviors and abilities, adding depth and excitement to your adventures in the stunning realms of Vanilla +.\n\n## Performance Friendly\nEnjoy an enchanting adventure that runs smoothly on a wide range of systems, ensuring accessibility without compromising the breathtaking beauty of Vanilla +.\n\n## Immersive Gameplay\nJourney through meticulously crafted landscapes, inviting you to immerse yourself in the breathtaking beauty and adventure of Vanilla +.\n\n## Includes Essentials Mod\nAdds a In-game Messenger, Allows you to invite friends to your Singleplayer World,\nHas a Screenshot Browser And a Wardrobe\n\n*Note: While optimized for most systems, Vanilla + may experience performance issues on low-end PCs.*",
